        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to join your city and explore the world together. Hang out, cruise the streets, and discover new places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>55 Challenges to Billionaire Status</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 55 exciting challenges and rise through the ranks to become a billionaire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join a Gang and Rule the Streets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side and join one of three rival gangs — <strong>Green Gunners, Blue Bandits, or Red Reapers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>bank heists, rescue missions, and high-speed formula races</strong> to prove your gang rules the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vast, Evolving World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a massive open world—from the bustling starting city and peaceful farmlands to River Town, the mystical Elven City, a Moon colony, and a fortified military base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule the Cities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful kings in epic battles to claim your throne in River Town and the Elven City. Your reign begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 10 thrilling boss fights against goblins, the undead, and more. Prove your strength and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master over 30 unique game modes—each with distinct gameplay, goals, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Cars &amp; Aircraft</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive high-speed cars through the streets or soar through the skies in powerful airplanes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Invest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>128 businesses</strong> and <strong>200 real estate opportunities</strong> to grow your empire and earn passive income like a true mogul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, raise animals, and turn your farm into a profitable business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and Earn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gold, diamonds, and cash by completing achievements and exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Tasks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a wide range of objectives to unlock powerful rewards and unlock new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love This Game</strong><br>Mixing adventure, simulation, and strategy, this world gives you total freedom. Whether you're racing, flying, farming, battling bosses, or building your empire—it’s your story to write.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start building your legacy today. Will you become a billionaire ruler or the ultimate tycoon?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends to join your city and explore the world together. Hang out, cruise the streets, and discover new places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>55 Challenges to Billionaire Status</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 55 exciting challenges and rise through the ranks to become a billionaire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join a Gang and Rule the Streets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your side and join one of three rival gangs — <strong>Green Gunners, Blue Bandits, or Red Reapers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>bank heists, rescue missions, and high-speed formula races</strong> to prove your gang rules the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vast, Evolving World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a massive open world—from the bustling starting city and peaceful farmlands to River Town, the mystical Elven City, a Moon colony, and a fortified military base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule the Cities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful kings in epic battles to claim your throne in River Town and the Elven City. Your reign begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 10 thrilling boss fights against goblins, the undead, and more. Prove your strength and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master over 30 unique game modes—each with distinct gameplay, goals, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Cars &amp; Aircraft</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive high-speed cars through the streets or soar through the skies in powerful airplanes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Invest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>128 businesses</strong> and <strong>200 real estate opportunities</strong> to grow your empire and earn passive income like a true mogul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, raise animals, and turn your farm into a profitable business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and Earn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gold, diamonds, and cash by completing achievements and exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Tasks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a wide range of objectives to unlock powerful rewards and unlock new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You’ll Love This Game</strong><br>Mixing adventure, simulation, and strategy, this world gives you total freedom. Whether you're racing, flying, farming, battling bosses, or building your empire—it’s your story to write.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start building your legacy today. Will you become a billionaire ruler or the ultimate tycoon?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Explore a massive world, conquer new game modes, and grow your fortune! From military zones to fantasy lands and the Moon, your adventure awaits.",
